== Description ==

'''Concrete''' is a building material in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Concrete Mixer]] and the [[Cutting Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 39 downstream recipes at the [[Cutting Workbench]] and the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Iron Rock Concrete]], [[Concrete]], [[Electric Motor Engine]], [[Sensor Spike]], [[Rotating Blade]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

